UPDATE companies SET description='Mom''s Meals, operating as PurFoods LLC, is headquartered in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma. The company has spent over 25 years developing food-as-medicine solutions aimed at reducing nutrition insecurity and improving health outcomes at home. While its exact founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed, the organization describes its origin as a mission to help people live healthier lives through delicious, nutritious food, education, and caring support.

The company produces medically tailored meals, shelf-stable meals, produce and pantry boxes, oral nutrition supplements, and halal and kosher meal options. Its nine menus offer more than 60 meal choices designed by registered dietitians and professional chefs. Production takes place in USDA- and FDA-inspected facilities across a network of locations strategically placed to enable nationwide delivery. In 2025, the company donated 59,863 medically tailored meals to individuals experiencing nutrition insecurity and provided 5,415 shelf-stable meals for Hurricane Helene relief in Georgia.

Mom''s Meals serves health plans, Area Agencies on Aging (AAAs), state governments, case managers, health care professionals, and individuals with caregivers. Concrete partnerships include AmeriHealth Caritas District of Columbia, where medically tailored meals reduced health care costs and readmissions, and the Maui County Office on Aging, recognized through a USAging Community Champion Award. The company also collaborates with Blue Shield of California Promise Health Plan to deliver shelf-stable meals in wildfire aftermath.

The company emphasizes evidence-based solutions that meet specific dietary needs, taste great, and reliably reach homes others cannot. Its differentiation rests on comprehensive food-as-medicine offerings that combine meals, nutrition counseling, and education to improve health outcomes, lower total cost of care, and bring comfort and dignity to those served.', certifications=ARRAY['USDA-inspected','FDA-inspected']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Medically tailored meal production", "Shelf-stable meal production", "Produce & pantry box assembly", "Oral nutrition supplement provision", "Halal meal preparation", "Kosher meal preparation", "Nutrition counseling and education", "Home delivery logistics"], "industries": ["Health plans", "Area Agencies on Aging (AAAs)", "State governments", "Case management", "Health care professionals", "Individuals and caregivers", "Disaster relief", "Senior services", "Chronic disease management"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Comprehensive food-as-medicine solutions including medically tailored meals, nutrition counseling, and produce boxes", "Nationwide delivery to any address via strategically located facilities", "Meals produced in USDA- and FDA-inspected facilities", "Menus designed by registered dietitians and professional chefs", "25-year track record addressing nutrition insecurity"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma -> db", "Produces medically tailored meals in USDA- and FDA-inspected facilities -> /", "Offers 9 menus with 60+ meal choices designed by registered dietitians and chefs -> /", "Delivers nationwide via strategically located facilities -> /about-us", "25-year history reducing food insecurity -> /about-us", "Donated 59,863 medically tailored meals in 2025 -> /", "Provided 5,415 shelf-stable meals for Hurricane Helene relief -> /about-us", "Serves health plans, AAAs, state governments, case managers, individuals and caregiv