UPDATE companies SET description='Montana Fine Furniture was established in 1993 in Belgrade, Montana. The owner’s personal narrative references a historic 1868 log barn on the property, underscoring a connection to traditional building methods, but the company’s own origin story is not detailed.

The company produces custom-designed furniture pieces, including dining tables, coffee tables, bedroom sets, headboards, and chairs. Production relies on fine joinery techniques such as dovetailing, careful selection of hardwoods, and handcrafted assembly. Materials featured in recent work include mahogany, curly maple, walnut, cherry, and reclaimed lumber, with occasional leather upholstery. No facility size, headcount, or annual volume figures are disclosed.

The client base consists primarily of individual customers seeking one-of-a-kind residential furnishings. Portfolio examples cited on the website include the Torii Coffee Table in mahogany and curly maple, a Figured Walnut Dining Set, a Leather Upholstered Headboard with matching nightstands, a Custom Bedroom Set in mahogany and walnut, a Big Sky Hall Table, a Mahogany Office Chair, and a Farmhouse Table built from reclaimed wood. No commercial or institutional sectors are explicitly mentioned.

The owner articulates a philosophy centered on preserving generational craftsmanship traditions, contrasting hand-built pieces with mass-produced disposable goods. The stated goal is to create objects that last for generations, improving each design for comfort, strength, visual appeal, and tactile quality. This commitment to heirloom durability is presented as the core differentiator.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture design", "Fine joinery (dovetail, mortise-and-tenon)", "Wood selection and milling", "Handcrafted assembly", "Leather upholstery integration"], "industries": ["Custom furniture manufacturing", "Residential interior furnishings"], "materials": ["Mahogany", "Curly Maple", "Walnut", "Cherry", "Reclaimed wood", "Leather"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Commitment to continuous design improvement for comfort, strength, and aesthetics", "Adherence to generational craftsmanship traditions", "Creation of heirloom-quality pieces intended to last generations", "Use of traditional joinery methods such as dovetailing"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1993 -> db", "Headquarters in Belgrade, Montana -> db", "Produces custom furniture with fine joinery -> /", "Uses mahogany, curly maple, walnut, cherry, reclaimed wood -> /", "Offers leather upholstery -> /", "Portfolio includes Torii Coffee Table, Figured Walnut Dining Set, Leather Upholstered Headboard, Custom Bedroom Set, Big Sky Hall Table, Mahogany Office Chair, Farmhouse Table -> /", "Philosophy of generational craftsmanship and heirloom durability -> /about-us", "Emphasis on traditional joinery (dovetail) -> /about-us", "Commitment to continuous design improvement -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We specialize in attention to detail, fine joinery, careful wood selection and the creation of original designs", "founded_year": "1993", "employee_count": "", "cage_code