UPDATE companies SET description='Moroso Performance Products is based in Guilford, Connecticut, and operates a manufacturing facility in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania where its ignition wire is produced. The company markets its components under two primary brands, Moroso and Competition Engineering (C.E.).

