UPDATE companies SET description='Murata Electronics North America, Inc. is headquartered in Westborough, Massachusetts. The company operates as the North American arm of Murata Manufacturing Co., Ltd., a global supplier of electronic components.

In addition to component manufacturing, Murata provides a product information management API covering 73 product categories, the SimSurfing simulation platform for component characterization, and application-specific solutions such as RFID systems for fashion, retail, healthcare, and manufacturing, as well as the efinnos renewable energy control solution.

Recent product announcements highlight automotive-grade components for CAN FD, ADAS, in-vehicle infotainment, and C-V2X communications, as well as components for humanoid robotics and AI infrastructure.

Murata emphasizes innovation in miniaturization and performance, citing achievements such as the world’s smallest 0201-inch three-terminal low-ESL MLCCs, the first 2.2 µF/100 Vdc soft-termination automotive MLCC in 0805 size, and mass production of automotive MLCCs with capacitance ratings. The company also underscores its commitment to simulation-driven design and comprehensive technical support through its online community and simulation tools.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electronic component manufacturing", "Product information management API", "Component simulation (SimSurfing)", "RFID solution development", "Renewable energy control system integration", "Technical documentation and catalogs", "Online technical community forum"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Fashion", "Retail", "Healthcare", "Manufacturing", "Renewable Energy", "Electronics", "Robotics", "Artificial Intelligence", "Advanced Driver-Assistance Systems (ADAS)", "In-Vehicle Infotainment (IVI)", "Cellular Vehicle-to-Everything (C-V2X)"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Product Information Management API covering all 73 product categories", "SimSurfing simulation software for component characterization", "World\u2019s smallest 0201-inch three-terminal low-ESL MLCCs", "First 2.2 \u00b5F/100 Vdc soft-termination automotive MLCC in 0805 size", "Automotive-grade chip ferrite beads with wideband noise suppression up to 5.9 GHz"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Westborough, Massachusetts -> db", "Operates as North American arm of Murata Manufacturing Co., Ltd. -> page /", "Broad portfolio of electronic components (capacitors, inductors, filters, resistors, sensors, etc.) -> page /", "Product Information Management API covering 73 product categories -> page /, db", "SimSurfing simulation software for component characterization -> page /", "RFID solutions for fashion, retail, healthcare, manufacturing -> page 