UPDATE companies SET description='Mustang Custom Woodworking operates out of Vancouver, Washington. Thompson describes his work as mixing his creative side with his mechanical nature to build one-of-a-kind pieces, a pursuit he finds rewarding because it meets specific client needs.

The shop specializes in custom woodworking, producing cabinetry, furniture, and dog kennels tailored to client specifications. Each piece is built to order, with Thompson handling design and fabrication from initial concept to final delivery.

