UPDATE companies SET description='N the Zone Ink operates from Bend, Oregon, serving Central Oregon as a custom apparel and promotional products company. The business focuses on screen printing, embroidery, and heat pressing for branded merchandise.

The shop provides a range of decoration services including screen printing, embroidery, heat press, sewing, and finishing, along with promotional products, stickers, banners, and online store management. A showroom Suite 4 stocks hundreds of garments, headwear, and promotional items from suppliers such as SanMar, Lane Seven, and Richardson, allowing customers to evaluate materials and decoration quality in person. The company does not accept customer-supplied garments, sourcing all items itself to maintain quality control.

Clients include businesses needing company uniforms, sports teams requiring jerseys and warm-up gear, retail brands, and event organizers. The company also serves small businesses and individuals seeking custom merchandise for promotional or personal use. Testimonials highlight work with local businesses in Bend and surrounding areas.

