UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1990 in Brooklyn Park, Minnesota, Nassau Foods began as a supplier focused on independent butcher shops and meat processors that larger distributors overlooked. The company was built to answer the phone, know the products, and treat a 10-case order with the same care as a pallet.

