UPDATE companies SET description='National Power Equipment, Inc. (NPE) operates from Cleveland, Ohio, where it was founded in 1994. The company began with a simple realization: industrial customers do not merely need equipment, they need a reliable source for solutions to fix and maintain large switchgear and circuit breakers.

